      "committer": {
        "name": "NeoTech",
        "email": "andreas@roughedge.se",
        "date": "2026-11-20T17:51:50Z"
      },
      "message": "test(sim): pin an operation step over a zero-time opening segment\n\nPR #2985 seats the opening rapid of an operation on its own entry X/Y,\nso the first segment of an operation can take no time. The new test\npins that such an operation is still a stop, that the playhead at its\nstart is in that operation, and that \"next\" from that start goes on\n(it does not stick on the zero-time segment and does not skip the\noperation). It covers a start with no connector and a start with one.\n\nRefs #2608\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
      "tree": {
